#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
plan-check — mechanical verifier for the EDD planning protocol's four gates
(framed, carved, sequenced, frozen).

Authority: docs/edd/planning-protocol.md (sole authority for what "correct" means).
This script implements ONLY the mechanical side of each gate's Verify: clause —
see docs/edd/tools/README.md for the full inventory and for what is deliberately
NOT checked (judgment calls the protocol itself reserves for a human/cold-review).

stdlib only. No pip installs, no network access.

Usage:
    plan-check --phase frame|carve|sequence|dispatch [--plan-dir DIR] [--repo-root DIR] [--json]

Exit codes: 0 clean (no FAIL) · 1 one or more FAIL · 2 usage/IO error.
"""

